    "blogtextliquid_ra7Awx": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Surviving a festival smelling incredible requires strategy. You need fragrance profiles built around notes that thrive in heat: solar florals, crisp citrus anchored by white musk, and sparkling woods that cut through sweat and dust.</p><p>You also need a three-day game plan that transitions smoothly from scorching afternoon sets to electric midnight afterparties. Here is the curated festival rotation that will keep you smelling sensational all weekend long.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_ji7beH": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_614820f",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Daytime Desert Heat vs Late-Night Festival Sets",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.1,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 30,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 25,
            "column_1_text": "<p>During the day, the desert sun beats down relentlessly. You need crisp, airy freshness that provides relief: bergamot, lavender, orange blossom, and sea salt. These notes feel refreshing and uplifting in open-air crowd settings.</p><p>Our top daytime pick is <strong>Liberty</strong> (inspired by Libre by YSL). The sparkling lavender and mandarin opening cuts through dry heat, while Moroccan orange blossom provides a chic, golden-hour radiance.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>Once the sun dips behind the desert mountains and the headliners take the main stage, the vibe shifts dramatically. You can pivot to deeper, more alluring profiles that leave an intoxicating trail in the cool night air.</p><p>Enter <strong>Black Poison</strong> (inspired by Black Opium by YSL) and <strong>Addiction</strong> (inspired by Baccarat Rouge 540). The rich coffee, vanilla, and saffron base notes blossom under stage lights and nocturnal breezes.</p>",
            "body_size": 17,
            "body_size_mobile": 15,
            "body_line_height": 1.9,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 55,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG"
      ],
      "name": "Editorial text section",
      "settings": {}
    },
    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>The three-day festival lineup: Fate & Feminine Fancy</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>Day Two is the marathon day. You need a fragrance that carries you effortlessly from afternoon lawn lounges into the headliner set without requiring constant reapplication.</p><p><strong>Fate</strong> (inspired by Chance EDP by Chanel) is the ultimate festival secret weapon. With pink pepper, jasmine, and amber patchouli, it has just enough spice to be interesting and enough crisp floral elegance to stay fresh in dusty winds.</p><p>When the midnight afterparty rolls around, a single spritz of <strong>Feminine Fancy</strong> (inspired by Good Girl by Carolina Herrera) on your collar delivers roasted tonka and cocoa depth that lasts until sunrise.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>Packing smart: pocket atomizers & travel sizes</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>Never bring a full 100ml glass bottle into a festival. Security can confiscate glass, and desert heat trapped inside festival lockers or cars will break down the delicate top notes of fine fragrance oils.</p><p>Decant into sleek, metallic pocket atomizers. They fit inside a fanny pack or cross-body bag, are indestructible, and allow quick, refreshing top-ups between music stages.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
