        "ai_gen_block_c88e324_m8PFU4": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_c88e324",
          "settings": {
            "container_width": 1100,
            "left_column_width": 45,
            "right_column_width": 55,
            "column_gap": 50,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "heading": "What this means when you are shopping",
            "heading_font": "serif",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "mobile_heading_size": 28,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_indent": 0,
            "mobile_heading_indent": 0,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/magnific_luxury-modern-perfume-cam_3002939618.png",
            "image_max_width": 500,
            "heading_image_gap": 16,
            "mobile_heading_image_gap": 20,
            "body_text": "<p>In high heat, avoid spraying directly onto sun-exposed skin if you will be standing in direct sunlight for hours, as high-concentration fragrance oils combined with UV rays can cause sun spots.</p><p>Instead, spray the nape of your neck beneath your hair, the fabric of your festival shirt, and your festival wristbands. Fabric holds scent molecules without UV degradation, creating a persistent scent bubble that survives the entire weekend.</p>",
            "body_font": "system_ui_n4",
            "body_size": 17,
            "mobile_body_size": 15,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
